llment-device-registration","content":"Enrollment Device Registration"},"944":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#enrollment-settings","content":"Enrollment Settings"},"945":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#authentication-per-operation","content":"Authentication per operation"},"946":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#external-webhook-settings","content":"External webhook settings"},"947":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#issuance-profile","content":"Issuance profile"},"948":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#re-enrollment-configuration","content":"Re-enrollment configuration"},"949":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#serverkeygen","content":"ServerKeyGen"},"950":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#trust-distribution","content":"Trust distribution"},"951":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#operate-the-dms-inventory","content":"Operate the DMS inventory"},"952":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#integrate-the-devices","content":"Integrate the devices"},"953":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","content":"A &#x2A;*Device Management Service (DMS)** configures admission and identity lifecycle for its devices. It acts as a registration authority; the CA selected in `Enrollment CA` signs certificates. This guide is for the policy administrator."},"954":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#before-you-begin","content":"You need DMS management permissions, an active CA with a usable key and a tested issuance profile. Agree device ID, initial credential, consumer and renewal window with the integrator. Review Provisioning strategies before choosing registration and replacement."},"955":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#before-you-begin","content":"Prepare EST server trust and device connectivity through Deployment. Your operator’s administrative authentication does not replace device EST authentication."},"956":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#identify-the-fleet","content":"Create the DMS with a recognizable name and retain its ID. EST URLs use this identifier, not the display name. Each device retains one owning DMS."},"957":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#select-the-enrollment-ca","content":"Choose **Enrollment CA** and an explicit profile appropriate for the end-entity identity. Keep CN compatible with `Device ID`. The test certificate should allow its intended purpose and expire within issuer validity."},"958":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#configure-est","content":"Select initial enrollment registration and authentication. Separately configure re-enrollment authentication, thresholds and previous certificate retirement. Leave ServerKeyGen disabled if the client generates its key."},"959":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#distribute-trust","content":"Select certificates returned by `/cacerts`. Explicitly include required intermediates and roots, keeping distribution distinct from automatic trust installation."},"960":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#verify-the-endpoints","content":"Save and read configuration again. Query `/cacerts`, perform an allowed and a rejected enrollment, and inspect device, serial and history. Creating the DMS or downloading cacerts does not establish working authentication and issuance."},"961":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#enrollment-device-registration","content":"`settings.enrollment_settings.registration_mode` accepts `JITP` or `PRE_REGISTRATION`. JITP creates an unknown device with the CSR CN as ID and the DMS as owner. `device_provisioning_profile` supplies tags, metadata and icon for that registration."},"962":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#enrollment-device-registration","content":"PRE\\_REGISTRATION requires an existing ID. In the inspected code, an existing device encounters replacement checks first, even without an identity. Review preregistration conditions before using this mode."},"963":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#enrollment-settings","content":"`settings.enrollment_settings` field"},"964":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#enrollment-settings","content":"Decision"},"965":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#enrollment-settings","content":"`protocol`"},"966":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#enrollment-settings","content":"`EST_RFC7030` for these operations."},"967":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#enrollment-settings","content":"`enrollment_ca`"},"968":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#enrollment-settings","content":"ID of the signing CA."},"969":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-35","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#enrollment-settings","content":"`verify_csr_signature`"},"970":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-36","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#enrollment-settings","content":"Keep `true` to verify CSR key possession."},"971":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-37","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type"