ent/dms-43","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#authentication-per-operation","content":"`settings.enrollment_settings.est_rfc7030_settings` for `/simpleenroll` and `/serverkeygen`."},"978":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-44","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#authentication-per-operation","content":"`settings.reenrollment_settings.est_rfc7030_settings` for `/simplereenroll`."},"979":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-45","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#authentication-per-operation","content":"`auth_mode`"},"980":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-46","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#authentication-per-operation","content":"Control applied in the configured operation"},"981":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-47","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#authentication-per-operation","content":"`CLIENT_CERTIFICATE`"},"982":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-48","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#authentication-per-operation","content":"Presented certificate validation."},"983":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-49","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#authentication-per-operation","content":"`EXTERNAL_WEBHOOK`"},"984":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-50","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#authentication-per-operation","content":"Configured webhook authorization."},"985":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-51","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#authentication-per-operation","content":"`CLIENT_CERTIFICATE_AND_EXTERNAL_WEBHOOK`"},"986":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-52","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#authentication-per-operation","content":"Certificate validation followed by webhook approval."},"987":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-53","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#authentication-per-operation","content":"`NO_AUTH`"},"988":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-54","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#authentication-per-operation","content":"No DMS requester authentication."},"989":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-55","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#authentication-per-operation","content":"Webhook and combined modes also execute during re-enrollment when configured in its block. They do not implicitly degrade to NO\\_AUTH. An absent or unrecognized mode fails."},"990":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-56","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#authentication-per-operation","content":"For initial mTLS, `client_certificate_settings` contains `validation_cas`, `allow_expired` and `chain_level_validation`. The inspected flow receives one certificate credential; it does not guarantee forwarding every handshake intermediate to the validator. For a direct case, configure the bootstrap’s direct issuer as validation CA and test the actual Gateway path."},"991":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-57","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#authentication-per-operation","content":"For certificate re-enrollment, the validator tries the enrollment CA first and then the CAs listed in `reenrollment_settings.est_rfc7030_settings.client_certificate_settings.validation_cas`; those are the re-enrollment validation CAs. That list is optional because the enrollment CA is always trusted for re-enrollment, and each settings block consults only its own `validation_cas`. CAs listed only in the initial block's `validation_cas` do not extend re-enrollment acceptance; during a CA rotation, add the old issuance CA to the re-enrollment block's list. The re-enrollment validator compares the presented TLS leaf against those CAs; the re-enrollment block's `chain_level_validation` and `allow_expired` values are stored but not consulted, and expiry is governed by `enable_expired_renewal`."},"992":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-58","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#authentication-per-operation","content":"For a webhook, configure destination, Lamassu-to-service authentication, method and timeout. The authentication contract explains the device credential and request body. `NO_AUTH` does not establish ownership of the requested ID."},"993":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-59","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#external-webhook-settings","content":"The webhook authentication modes read `external_webhook_settings` in the same `est_rfc7030_settings` block:"},"994":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-60","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#external-webhook-settings","content":"`external_webhook_settings` field"},"995":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-61","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#external-webhook-settings","content":"Decision"},"996":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-62","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#external-webhook-settings","content":"`url`"},"997":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-63","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#external-webhook-settings","content":"Absolute `http` or `https` URL of the receiver. It must be the final URL; redirects are not followed."},"998":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-64","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#external-webhook-settings","content":"`method`"},"999":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-65","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#external-webhook-settings","content":"`POST` or `PUT`; `POST` by default."},"1000":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-66","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#external-webhook-settings","content":"`name`"},"1001":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-67","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#external-webhook-settings","content":"Label used in service logs."},"1002":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-68","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#external-webhook-settings","content":"`config.auth_mode`"},"1003":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-69","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#external-webhook-settings","content":"`noauth`, `apikey`, `jwt` or `mtls`. An absent or unknown value behaves as `noauth`."},"1004":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-70","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#external-webhook-settings","content":"`config.log_level`"},"1005":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-71","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#external-webhook-settings","content":"Log level of the webhook call: `debug`, `info`, `warn` or `error`; `info` by default."},"1006":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-72","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#external-webhook-settings","content":"`config.apikey_options`"},"1007":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-73","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#external-webhook-settings","content":"Required for `apikey`: `header` and `key`. Reserved header names are rejected."},"1008":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-74","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#external-webhook-settings","content":"`config.jwt_options`"},"1009":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-75","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#external-webhook-settings","content":"Required for `jwt`: `oidc_client_id`, `oidc_client_secret` and an absolute `http` or `https` `oidc_well_known`."},"1010":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-76","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#external-webhook-settings","content":"`config.mtls_options`"},"1011":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-77","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#external-webhook-settings","content":"Required for `mtls`: `cert_content` and `key_content` as Base64-encoded PEM, like certificates elsewhere in the API; plain PEM is also accepted."},"1012":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-78","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#external-webhook-settings","content":"`config.insecure_skip_verify`"},"1013":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-79","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#external-webhook-settings","content":"Skips verification of the receiver certificate when `true`. Verification is on by default. Unlike alert channels, this flag is honored here."},"1014":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-80","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#external-webhook-settings","content":"`config.call_timeout`"},"1015":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-81","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#external-webhook-settings","content":"Maximum duration of the authorization call (for example `10s`); 10 seconds by default."},"1016":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-82","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#external-webhook-settings","content":"Rules for that configuration:"},"1017":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-83","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#external-webhook-settings","content":"Creating or updating a DMS whose enrollment or reenrollment `auth_mode` uses the webhook validates the block and returns HTTP 400 — the body starts with `struct validation error:` and continues with `invalid enrollment external webhook config` or `invalid reenrollment external webhook config` — when the URL, method or options are invalid. That includes an `mtls_options.cert_content`/`key_content` pair that does not decode to a matching certificate and private key. File references (`ca_cert_file`, `mtls_options.cert_file`, `mtls_options.key_file`) are always invalid: the service does not read files, so enter the certificate and key as Base64-encoded PEM in `mtls_options.cert_content` and `key_content`, or as plain PEM."},"1018":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-84","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#external-webhook-settings","content":"A custom `apikey_options.header` may not use names that the platform or the receiving service trusts — for example `X-Principal-Id`, `X-Request-Id`, `Host`, `Content-Type` or `Forwarded` — and no name may start with `X-Forwarded-`, `X-Envoy-` or `X-Lms-` (case-insensitive). The DMS API reference documents the `WebhookCall` and `WebhookCallHttpClient` schemas and that reserved API-key headers are rejected."},"1019":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-85","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#external-webhook-settings","content":"The nested `http_client` key exists only in alert channel configurations; in a DMS body it is ignored. The DMS key is `external_webhook_settings.config`."},"1020":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-86","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#external-webhook-settings","content":"A body with `config.auth_mode` set to `apikey`, `jwt` or `mtls` must carry its corresponding option block (`apikey_options`, `jwt_options` or `mtls_options`) — and nothing else. Bodies with those auth modes carrying only `apikey`, `oidc` or `mtls` fail validation with 400, and `validate_server_cert` is always ignored: use `insecure_skip_verify`. Only bodies without option blocks are accepted as `noauth`, and their credentials are dropped."},"1021":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-87","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#external-webhook-settings","content":"The authorization response must be JSON of at most 1 MiB; a larger body fails the call."},"1022":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-88","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#external-webhook-settings","content":"With credentials configured, they are sent regardless of the URL scheme: an `http://` webhook receives the API key or bearer token in cleartext, and mTLS has no effect because no TLS handshake takes place, so the client certificate is never presented. Prefer `https://` for `url`, `oidc_well_known` and the token endpoint it advertises."},"1023":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-89","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#external-webhook-settings","content":"Initial authentication and renewal settings are stored independently. If a DMS only has the initial authentication block, renewal reuses it: read both blocks before editing. The console exposes independent editors for the enrollment and re-enrollment authentication, with the same Log Level, Call Timeout, HTTP Authentication and credential fields as the webhook channels, plus a **Skip TLS Verification** switch (off by default, so verification stays on; the console warns when you enable it)."},"1024":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-90","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#external-webhook-settings","content":"Webhook credentials must be stored as PEM content. File references (`ca_cert_file`, `mtls_options.cert_file`, `mtls_options.key_file`) are never valid in a stored webhook config: delivery rejects any webhook config that references files, whatever its auth mode, so every enroll and reenroll that calls that webhook fails until the certificate and key are entered as Base64-encoded or plain PEM in `mtls_options.cert_content` and `key_content`, or the file fields are removed if the webhook does not use mTLS. If a stored config holds file paths in `mtls_options.cert_content` or `key_content`, every full settings update (`POST /v1/dms`, `PUT /v1/dms/:id`) fails validation — settings are replaced wholesale, so the stored config must be resent — until the values are replaced by PEM content or the webhook stops being used. Meanwhile, delivery of that webhook fails on every call; a metadata-only update through `PUT` or `PATCH` on `/v1/dms/:id/metadata` still succeeds. To fix it in the console, open the DMS, replace any file-path value with PEM content — the editor rejects file paths with an inline field error — and save. Saving rewrites `external_webhook_settings.config` with the current keys, and the console reads both plain and Base64-encoded PEM from migrated configurations and stores the material Base64-encoded. If your stored config previously relied on `validate_server_cert: false`, it now carries `insecure_skip_verify: true`: receiver-certificate verification stays skipped until you set that flag to `false`. See 3.8.0 to 4.0.0 for the upgrade notes and the operator checklist."},"1025":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-91","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#external-webhook-settings","content":"The re-enrollment trust set lives in `reenrollment_settings.est_rfc7030_settings.client_certificate_settings.validation_cas`. The flat field `reenrollment_settings.additional_validation_cas` is not part of the API: bodies that carry it are accepted but the value is silently ignored — unknown JSON fields are dropped — and GET responses do not include it. Read the DMS before sending API edits: an update body built with that flat field silently empties `validation_cas`."},"1026":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-92","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#issuance-profile","content":"`settings.issuance_profile_id` takes precedence over `settings.issuance_profile`; without either, the CA default profile is used. The resolved profile — including the CA default used as fallback when the DMS defines none — must define an end-entity certificate: a `Sign as CA` profile is rejected at enrollment and re-enrollment time. Rules are documented once in Profiles. DMS changes affect future requests; they do not modify signed certificates or install client trust."},"1027":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-93","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#re-enrollment-configuration","content":"`settings.reenrollment_settings` field"},"1028":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-94","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#re-enrollment-configuration","content":"Purpose"},"1029":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-95","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#re-enrollment-configuration","content":"`reenrollment_delta`"},"1030":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-96","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#re-enrollment-configuration","content":"Opens the window at the active certificate’s `NotAfter` minus this delta."},"1031":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-97","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#re-enrollment-configuration","content":"`preventive_delta`"},"1032":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-98","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#re-enrollment-configuration","content":"Preventive operational monitoring threshold."},"1033":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-99","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#re-enrollment-configuration","content":"`critical_delta`"},"1034":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-100","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#re-enrollment-configuration","content":"Critical operational monitoring threshold."},"1035":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-101","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#re-enrollment-configuration","content":"`enable_expired_renewal`"},"1036":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-102","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#re-enrollment-configuration","content":"Accepts an expired presented certificate in the renewal mTLS validator. Does not authorize another mode or remove Gateway constraints by itself."},"1037":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-103","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#re-enrollment-configuration","content":"`est_rfc7030_settings.client_certificate_settings.validation_cas`"},"1038":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-104","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#re-enrollment-configuration","content":"Re-enrollment validation CAs for the renewal mTLS credential, tried after the enrollment CA; optional, because the enrollment CA is always trusted. Typically populated during CA rotation while old-CA cohorts renew."},"1039":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-105","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#re-enrollment-configuration","content":"`revoke_on_reenrollment`"},"1040":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-106","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#re-enrollment-configuration","content":"If the previous certificate is ACTIVE, attempts Superseded revocation before binding its successor."},"1041":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-107","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#re-enrollment-configuration","content":"Monitoring does not renew: the client must schedule the request and installation. Webhook and NO\\_AUTH modes do not use the same mTLS expired-credential validator; the webhook must explicitly authorize permitted recovery. Review Renewal and recovery for operation order and partial failures."},"1042":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-108","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#serverkeygen","content":"`settings.server_keygen_settings.enabled` enables software key generation on the server. The console exposes it through an **Enable server-side key generation** switch and a **Key type** selection: `ECDSA` P-256, P-384 or P-521, or `RSA` with 2048, 3072 or 4096 bits; the defaults are P-256 for `ECDSA` and 4096 bit for `RSA`. Algorithm and size come from its `key` field, stored as `{type,bits}` where P-256, P-384 and P-521 map to `bits` 256, 384 and 521; `key` is omitted when disabled. The profile must permit them. The response contains an unencrypted PKCS#8 key inside TLS alongside the certificate. See format and extraction in EST reference."},"1043":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-109","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#trust-distribution","content":"Option"},"1044":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-110","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#trust-distribution","content":"Published material"},"1045":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-111","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#trust-distribution","content":"**Include Lamassu System CA**"},"1046":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-112","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#trust-distribution","content":"Available downstream TLS certificate; it can be a leaf, not an issuing CA."},"1047":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-113","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#trust-distribution","content":"**Include Enrollment CA**"},"1048":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-114","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#trust-distribution","content":"Selected issuing CA certificate."},"1049":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-115","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#trust-distribution","content":"**Managed CAs**"},"1050":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-116","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#trust-distribution","content":"Explicitly selected CA certificates."},"1051":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-117","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#trust-distribution","content":"All ancestors are not added automatically. Trust distribution distinguishes trusted roots, intermediates and initial server trust."},"1052":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-118","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#operate-the-dms-inventory","content":"**Edit** changes name, settings and metadata. Updates go through the DMS API. `PUT /v1/dms/{id}` always targets the DMS identified by the URL path: the body carries no `id` field, and any `id` or `creation_ts` in it is silently ignored — authorization is evaluated against the same URL identifier. The body must include a non-empty `name` and a `settings` object; missing either returns HTTP 400 and leaves the stored DMS unchanged. `name` and `settings` are always full replacements, so read the DMS before sending API edits to avoid losing fields. `metadata` is optional: omitting it or sending `null` keeps the stored metadata, a supplied object replaces it entirely, and `{}` clears it (a later GET returns an empty object, not `null`). Old-style bodies that carry the full DMS object keep working while they include `name` and `settings`; unknown fields are ignored. Updates reject an empty `name` with HTTP 400: a DMS whose stored name was zeroed by an earlier update must be renamed before any client round-trips it — the AWS IoT connector’s JITP writeback included. If the object does not include the AWS IoT connector key (`lamassu.io/iot/{connector_id}`), the connector ignores the DMS's later events."},"1053":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-119","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#operate-the-dms-inventory","content":"**Go to DMS owned devices** restricts inventory by owner. **Show/Edit Metadata** contains operational and integration data; consult the integration guide before changing it. &#x2A;*EST (RFC-7030)** helps locate URLs."},"1054":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-120","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#operate-the-dms-inventory","content":"**Delete** removes the DMS record and configuration; it does not itself cascade revocation across every device and certificate. Migrate dependencies and retain audit references before retirement."},"1055":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-121","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#integrate-the-devices","content":"Continue with EST client or the enrollment and mTLS tutorial. EST reference covers formats; Troubleshooting covers failures."},"1056":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","type":"page","content":"Integrate the EST client","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Platform","IoT Fleets","Devices and identities","Enrollment with PKI"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client"},"1057":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","content":"Prepare trust, send a CSR and check the identity you receive."},"1058":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client#before-you-begin","content":"Before you begin"},"1059":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client#download-and-inspect-cacerts","content":"Download and inspect cacerts"},"1060":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client#prepare-the-csr","content":"Prepare the CSR"},"1061":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client#request-the-identity","content":"Request the identity"},"1062":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client#check-and-install-the-result","content":"Check and install the result"},"1063":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client#next-steps","content":"Next steps"},"1064":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","content":"This guide is for those implementing the device client. The administrator must have prepared the DMS policy. For a complete first run, follow Enroll and connect your first device."},"1065":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client#before-you-begin","content":"You need the public HTTPS DMS URL, server trust obtained through an approved channel, the operation's authentication mode and an admitted identifier. The examples use Bash, OpenSSL 3.x and curl with `--fail-with-body`; use a private working directory and compatible versions of these tools."},"1066":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client#before-you-begin","content":"Prepare `est-trust.pem` to verify the EST server, `bootstrap.crt` and `bootstrap.key` for initial certificate authentication, and `device-root.pem` as the approved root of the device issuer. The two trust files can contain different roots. For another authentication mode, adapt the credentials according to Bootstrap identity."},"1067":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client#before-you-begin","content":"Replace the host and `REPLACE_DMS_ID` with those of your installation. The URL's APS is the DMS identifier, not its display name."},"1068":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client#download-and-inspect-cacerts","content":"The default content is Base64-encoded DER PKCS#7. It is not a direct PEM file."},"1069":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client#download-and-inspect-cacerts","content":"Check fingerprints, issuers and dates against the trust distribution policy. The response can contain a selection of CAs and Lamassu's TLS certificate. Do not turn the entire bundle into trusted roots or use it to authenticate its own initial download. HTTP 200 here does not prove that authentication or issuance works."},"1070":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client#prepare-the-csr","content":"The example generates a new EC P-256 key and uses `est-device-001`, which must be available if the DMS registers automatically. The `Common Name` becomes the device identifier. Check that the profile permits the selected key and subject."},"1071":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client#prepare-the-csr","content":"An implementation using hardware or its own store must produce the CSR through its resident key. `simpleenroll` sends the request and retains the key in the client. Honor Extensions does not authorize every requested attribute: see Profiles."},"1072":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client#request-the-identity","content":"With initial `CLIENT_CERTIFICATE` authentication, send the Base64-encoded DER CSR using `Content-Type: application/pkcs10`:"},"1073":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client#request-the-identity","content":"Stop if curl fails. Retain the HTTP code, headers and body for diagnosis; an error response is not decoded as a certificate. The Bash example stops before that conversion. A timeout leaves the operation's result to be checked in Lamassu: do not automatically repeat issuance."},"1074":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client#check-and-install-the-result","content":"For a root that issues directly:"},"1075":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client#check-and-install-the-result","content":"Also verify that the CN is correct, the certificate is a leaf, its uses permit your application and its dates satisfy the profile. `cmp` must exit with code 0. With intermediates, provide the chain through `-untrusted` as described in PKI validation."},"1076":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client#check-and-install-the-result","content":"Query the device: the owning DMS, current serial number and history must match the result. Protect the key/certificate pair and install both using the device's mechanism. Association in Lamassu does not install files in the client. Check a real connection before considering the process complete."},"1077":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client#next-steps","content":"Implement renewal and recovery and trust updates. The EST reference covers endpoints, formats and ServerKeyGen; troubleshooting helps distinguish transport, admission and persistence failures."},"1078":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","type":"page","content":"EST reference","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Platform","IoT Fleets","Devices and identities","Enrollment with PKI"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference"},"1079":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","content":"Look up Lamassu routes, formats, authentication and multipart responses."},"1080":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#endpoint-reference","content":"Endpoint reference"},"1081":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#cacerts","content":"cacerts"},"1082":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#simpleenroll","content":"simpleenroll"},"1083":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#simplereenroll","content":"simplereenroll"},"1084":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#serverkeygen","content":"serverkeygen"},"1085":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#response-format","content":"Response format"},"1086":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#request-and-extraction","content":"Request and extraction"},"1087":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#compatibility-notes","content":"Compatibility notes"},"1088":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","content":"Reference for the examined backend, based on RFC 7030. Use EST client for the procedure and DMS to configure policy."},"1089":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#endpoint-reference","content":"Public route in the examples: `/.well-known/est/{APS}/{operation}`. `APS` is the DMS ID. The router admits routes without that segment, but the controller requires it; do not use them as a default service. Gateway configuration determines the public host and route."},"1090":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#endpoint-reference","content":"Operation"},"1091":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#endpoint-reference","content":"Method"},"1092":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#endpoint-reference","content":"Authentication and condition"},"1093":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#endpoint-reference","content":"`/cacerts`"},"1094":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#endpoint-reference","content":"GET"},"1095":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#endpoint-reference","content":"DMS reading does not require an EST credential; HTTPS and infrastructure controls still apply."},"1096":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#endpoint-reference","content":"`/simpleenroll`"},"1097":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#endpoint-reference","content":"POST"},"1098":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#endpoint-reference","content":"Initial authentication and DMS registration/replacement policy."},"1099":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#endpoint-reference","content":"`/simplereenroll`"},"1100":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#endpoint-reference","content":"POST"},"1101":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#endpoint-reference","content":"Renewal authentication, existing identity, subject, revocation and window."},"1102":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#endpoint-reference","content":"`/serverkeygen`"},"1103":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#endpoint-reference","content":"POST"},"1104":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#endpoint-reference","content":"Initial authentication and admission; server generation enabled."},"1105":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#endpoint-reference","content":"These routes do not implement `/csrattrs` or `/fullcmc`. There is no native JWT EST authentication mode; a webhook can interpret a request credential according to its own contract."},"1106":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#cacerts","content":"The default response has `Content-Type: application/pkcs7-mime; smime-type=certs-only` and `Content-Transfer-Encoding: base64`. The body is Base64-encoded DER PKCS#7 with lines of up to 76 characters. It includes the certificates selected by the DMS, not necessarily every ancestor."},"1107":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#cacerts","content":"`Accept: application/x-pem-file` requests the bundle in PEM through a Lamassu extension. Inspect and approve its contents before modifying trusted roots."},"1108":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#simpleenroll","content":"Send a Base64-encoded DER PKCS#10 CSR with `Content-Type: application/pkcs10`. The examined controller compares that media type literally; avoid adding parameters such as charset. The CN identifies the device and the CSR signature must be verified through DMS policy."},"1109":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#simpleenroll","content":"The default response uses the PKCS#7/Base64 format described for cacerts, but contains the issued certificate; do not assume it includes its entire chain. `Accept: application/x-pem-file` returns that certificate in PEM. The client retains the key that signed the CSR."},"1110":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#simplereenroll","content":"Use the same request and certificate response formats. Authentication comes from the independent `reenrollment_settings.est_rfc7030_settings` block. With a client certificate, its CN must match the CSR CN; the subject is also checked against the current certificate."},"1111":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#simplereenroll","content":"In mTLS mode, the enrollment CA always validates the re-enrollment credential; certificates from other issuers are accepted only if they are listed as validation CAs in the re-enrollment block. The expiry check through `enable_expired_renewal` belongs to that validator. A revoked current certificate and a request before the window are rejected. See Renewal for installation and recovery."},"1112":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#serverkeygen","content":"The server generates a software key, rebuilds the CSR with that key and performs initial enrollment. The flag must be enabled and the algorithm permitted by the profile. This operation's key does not become a hardware key because the CA is hosted in an HSM."},"1113":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#serverkeygen","content":"The code supports RSA and ECDSA, and the `bits` value of the DMS key setting means something different for each. For ECDSA it selects the curve: 224, 256, 384 or 521 map to P-224, P-256, P-384 and P-521, and an unrecognized size falls back to P-256, so explicitly select a compatible size and check the resulting key. For RSA it is used directly as the modulus size; the console offers 2048, 3072 and 4096 bits. Do not reuse an enrolled ID to test this operation without reviewing replacement."},"1114":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-35","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#response-format","content":"The body is **MIME multipart/mixed**, with the boundary specified in `Content-Type`. It contains two parts:"},"1115":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-36","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#response-format","content":"Part"},"1116":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-37","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#response-format","content":"Content after decoding its Base64"},"1117":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-38","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#response-format","content":"`application/pkcs8`"},"1118":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-39","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#response-format","content":"Unencrypted DER PKCS#8 private key."},"1119":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-40","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#response-format","content":"`application/pkcs7-mime; smime-type=certs-only`"},"1120":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-41","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#response-format","content":"DER PKCS#7 containing the issued certificate."},"1121":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-42","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#response-format","content":"The controller also adds `Content-Transfer-Encoding: base64` to the outer header, although the outer body is MIME text. &#x2A;*Do not Base64-decode the entire body.** Read the actual boundary and decode each part according to its headers."},"1122":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-43","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#request-and-extraction","content":"In a Bash session with `set -euo pipefail` and `umask 077`, use `EST_BASE` and the trust/bootstrap files from EST client. Select an available and admitted `est-serverkeygen-001`. The `server-request.key` only signs the input CSR; the received identity uses the server-generated key."},"1123":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-44","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#request-and-extraction","content":"Save this Python 3 extractor. It validates both parts before writing and rejects existing output files:"},"1124":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-45","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#request-and-extraction","content":"Convert and check the result:"},"1125":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-46","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#request-and-extraction","content":"Inspect the CN, serial, dates and uses; check association in Lamassu before installing. Protect the DER and PEM files containing the key and remove temporary copies according to the device's storage mechanism. See openssl-pkcs8 and the Python MIME parser."},"1126":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-47","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#compatibility-notes","content":"Do not interpret every 500 as a transient failure. Invalid input typically produces 400; service denials and errors typically produce 500 with a JSON `err` body. Gateway errors and some controller paths can have another format. Retain headers and body before decoding and see troubleshooting."},"1127":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-48","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#compatibility-notes","content":"The examples use openssl-pkcs7 to extract certificates and openssl-x509 to prepare renewal. Check your version's capabilities and responses before integrating a generic EST client."},"1128":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","type":"page","content":"Enrollment with PKI","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Platform","IoT Fleets","Devices and identities","Enrollment with PKI"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview"},"1129":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","content":"Choose admission policy and connect DMS, initial trust and the EST client."},"1130":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview#the-journey","content":"The journey"},"1131":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview#for-the-administrator","content":"For the administrator"},"1132":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview#for-the-integrator","content":"For the integrator"},"1133":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview#contract-version","content":"Contract version"},"1134":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","content":"Enrollment with PKI covers the path from device admission to identity installation and renewal. The DMS acts as a registration authority: it authenticates the request, applies registration policy and asks the CA to sign. The client keeps or receives the key, installs the result and presents it to the consumer."},"1135":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview#the-journey","content":"The administrator prepares the CA, issuance profile and DMS."},"1136":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview#the-journey","content":"The integrator installs initial EST server trust and an admission credential."},"1137":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview#the-journey","content":"The client requests an identity for its `Device ID` through EST."},"1138":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview#the-journey","content":"Certificate, device binding and key/certificate installation are checked."},"1139":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview#the-journey","content":"The consumer validates and authorizes the identity; the client schedules renewal and recovery."},"1140":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview#the-journey","content":"EST uses `/.well-known/est/{DMS_ID}`. Administrative APIs and manual assignment remain separate paths. Enroll and connect a device completes an initial mTLS test."},"1141":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview#for-the-administrator","content":"<Card title=\"Provisioning strategies\" description=\"Choose automatic registration, preregistration or manual assignment.\" href=\"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies\" />"},"1142":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview#for-the-administrator","content":"<Card title=\"Configure the DMS\" description=\"Separate admission, authentication per operation, profiles and distribution.\" href=\"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms\" />"},"1143":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview#for-the-administrator","content":"<Card title=\"Bootstrap identity and authentication\" description=\"Decide which proof allows requesting the first identity.\" href=\"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity\" />"},"1144":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview#for-the-administrator","content":"<Card title=\"Trust distribution\" description=\"Update roots and chains with verified overlap.\" href=\"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution\" />"},"1145":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview#for-the-integrator","content":"<Card title=\"EST client\" description=\"Prepare the request, verify the response and install the identity.\" href=\"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client\" />"},"1146":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview#for-the-integrator","content":"<Card title=\"Renewal and recovery\" description=\"Generate the successor and handle expired or lost credentials.\" href=\"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery\" />"},"1147":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview#for-the-integrator","content":"<Card title=\"EST reference\" description=\"Look up paths, formats, authentication and ServerKeyGen.\" href=\"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference\" />"},"1148":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview#for-the-integrator","content":"<Card title=\"Troubleshooting\" description=\"Distinguish transport, policy, issuance and installation failures.\" href=\"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting\" />"},"1149":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview#contract-version","content":"This block describes `main` code inspected at commit `8f42c47157f9a36bac3ed5caa3692aebebe19c4b`. The site catalog publishes `main (unstable)`; this behavior is not attributed to a stable release. Before using another version, check its contract, particularly independent re-enrollment authentication. Client checks and live-instance tests are distinguished in the revision plan."},"1150":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview#contract-version","content":"Gateway, TLS, provider and service configuration belongs to Deployment. Identity use in AWS or other destinations belongs to Integrations."},"1151":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","type":"page","content":"Provisioning strategies","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Platform","IoT Fleets","Devices and identities","Enrollment with PKI"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies"},"1152":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","content":"Choose device registration, identity authorization and key generation."},"1153":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#choose-registration","content":"Choose registration"},"1154":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#preregistration-and-replacement","content":"Preregistration and replacement"},"1155":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#choose-authentication","content":"Choose authentication"},"1156":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#choose-custody","content":"Choose custody"},"1157":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#check-the-decision","content":"Check the decision"},"1158":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","content":"This guide helps the provisioning administrator choose a path before configuring the DMS. Separate three decisions: when the device exists, how its request is authorized and who generates its key. None grants destination access by itself."},"1159":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#choose-registration","content":"Path"},"1160":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#choose-registration","content":"When the device exists"},"1161":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#choose-registration","content":"What to check"},"1162":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#choose-registration","content":"Manual assignment"},"1163":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#choose-registration","content":"An operator creates it before associating a certificate."},"1164":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#choose-registration","content":"ID, owning DMS, certificate CN and bound serial."},"1165":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#choose-registration","content":"EST with `JITP`"},"1166":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#choose-registration","content":"Created for an unknown CN during `/simpleenroll`."},"1167":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#choose-registration","content":"Authorized credential, unused ID, profile, resulting registration and identity."},"1168":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#choose-registration","content":"EST with `PRE_REGISTRATION`"},"1169":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#choose-registration","content":"Must exist before `/simpleenroll`."},"1170":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#choose-registration","content":"Approved record, same DMS and replacement conditions for your version."},"1171":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#choose-registration","content":"Lamassu `JITP` creates inventory and identity in Lamassu. AWS JITP provisions a destination in AWS; these are separate decisions."},"1172":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#choose-registration","content":"For an initial client test, use Enroll and connect a device. To prepare inventory without EST, follow Manual registration."},"1173":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#preregistration-and-replacement","content":"In the inspected code, finding any device owned by the same DMS triggers the `enable_replaceable_enrollment` check before PRE\\_REGISTRATION. With the flag disabled, a preregistered device can receive `forbiddenNewEnrollment` even in **No Identity**. Selecting PRE\\_REGISTRATION alone therefore does not establish a working path."},"1174":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#preregistration-and-replacement","content":"Enabling the flag permits repeated `/simpleenroll` for an existing ID. The backend schedules a deferred attempt to revoke the previous certificate with `Superseded`; it can also run if later issuance or binding fails. Without an identity, that attempt can fail because no serial exists. The flag does not provide a replacement transaction or guarantee restoration of previous state."},"1175":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#preregistration-and-replacement","content":"Test the exact case on your version before enabling it for a population. For an operational identity with authorized renewal, use `/simplereenroll`; for recovery, follow Renewal and recovery and check persisted state before retrying."},"1176":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#choose-authentication","content":"Decide initial enrollment and re-enrollment separately:"},"1177":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#choose-authentication","content":"**Client certificate:** useful when each device has an initial credential whose key it controls."},"1178":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#choose-authentication","content":"**Webhook:** useful when another authority knows inventory, credentials or entitlement to a requested ID."},"1179":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#choose-authentication","content":"**Certificate and webhook:** requires both controls in the configured operation."},"1180":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#choose-authentication","content":"**NO\\_AUTH:** does not establish requester identity; appropriate only when admission is deliberately controlled outside that DMS."},"1181":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#choose-authentication","content":"Authenticating an initial certificate does not itself establish entitlement to choose any CSR CN. Define that authorization in Bootstrap identity and authentication."},"1182":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#choose-custody","content":"Option"},"1183":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#choose-custody","content":"Material crossing EST"},"1184":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#choose-custody","content":"Device-generated key"},"1185":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#choose-custody","content":"Public CSR and certificate; the key stays on the client."},"1186":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#choose-custody","content":"Existing device key"},"1187":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-35","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#choose-custody","content":"CSR signed with that key and a new certificate."},"1188":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-36","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#choose-custody","content":"ServerKeyGen"},"1189":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-37","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#choose-custody","content":"Private PKCS#8 key and certificate in a TLS-protected multipart response."},"1190":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-38","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#choose-custody","content":"ServerKeyGen does not automatically use the CA’s HSM or KMS for the device key. Review its contract and extraction and the device’s ability to install the material."},"1191":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-39","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#check-the-decision","content":"Before expanding the flow, test allowed registration, incorrect credentials, an ID owned by another DMS, repeated requests and recovery after failure. Keep ID, serial, active version and error. Also test consumer acceptance and rejection; issuance does not imply destination registration or permission to operate."},"1192":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","type":"page","content":"Renewal and recovery","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Platform","IoT Fleets","Devices and identities","Enrollment with PKI"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery"},"1193":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","content":"Renew without losing the identity and recover devices according to their actual state."},"1194":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#prepare-renewal","content":"Prepare renewal"},"1195":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#request-the-successor-certificate","content":"Request the successor certificate"},"1196":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#install-and-check-the-new-pair","content":"Install and check the new pair"},"1197":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#recover-according-to-state","content":"Recover according to state"},"1198":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#continuous-operation","content":"Continuous operation"},"1199":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","content":"Renewal retains the device identifier and requests a successor certificate. The client must complete the process: check the response, install the matching pair and demonstrate that the consumer accepts it. Lamassu alerts notify you; they do not perform those steps."},"1200":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#prepare-renewal","content":"Query the current certificate in Lamassu and compare it with the installed certificate. You need its subject, serial and dates, as well as the client key."},"1201":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#prepare-renewal","content":"Check the **re-enrollment** authentication mode: it is independent of initial authentication. With `CLIENT_CERTIFICATE`, use the current identity; do not assume the bootstrap credential is admitted."},"1202":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#prepare-renewal","content":"Calculate the window's start: the current certificate's `NotAfter` minus `reenrollment_delta`. Preventive and critical thresholds produce states/notifications; they do not extend that window."},"1203":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#prepare-renewal","content":"Review **Revoke on Re-enrollment** and recovery if installation fails. When enabled, Lamassu can revoke the previous identity before the client installs the new one."},"1204":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#request-the-successor-certificate","content":"The example continues the EST tutorial, in the same Bash session with `set -euo pipefail`, `umask 077` and `EST_BASE`. Use a new key compatible with the profile. Conversion from the certificate preserves the subject and copies only SAN when present; check the subject and requested names before sending it. The backend checks the subject against the current identity: it attempts RawSubject equality and then compares CN, OU, O, L, ST and C. Rebuilding only the CN can lose required attributes."},"1205":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#request-the-successor-certificate","content":"The request authenticates with `device.crt` and `device.key`; the CSR contains the new public key. Also check extensions, dates and correspondence of the serial with the current slot in Lamassu. Do not resubmit a failed request without querying that state: issuance, previous revocation and successor binding can have partial results."},"1206":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#install-and-check-the-new-pair","content":"Keep the result as `device.next.crt` and `device.next.key` until verified. Switch the pair through a coordinated operation in the device store or configuration; avoid temporarily exposing a certificate with another version's key."},"1207":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#install-and-check-the-new-pair","content":"Test mTLS with the consumer and verify that it uses the new serial. Confirm the history and current certificate in Lamassu. If **Revoke on Re-enrollment** was disabled, the previous identity can remain valid: retire it according to PKI policy after testing the successor, and check revocation publication and consumption."},"1208":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#install-and-check-the-new-pair","content":"If the previous identity is already revoked, retaining its files does not restore a valid connection. Recovery requires an admitted credential and authorized intervention according to the situation."},"1209":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#recover-according-to-state","content":"Situation"},"1210":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#recover-according-to-state","content":"Procedure"},"1211":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#recover-according-to-state","content":"Valid certificate, outside the window"},"1212":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#recover-according-to-state","content":"Schedule the request within the window. Do not use `simpleenroll` to bypass it."},"1213":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#recover-according-to-state","content":"Expired certificate, key available"},"1214":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#recover-according-to-state","content":"With certificate authentication, review `enable_expired_renewal` and whether Gateway permits presenting that credential. Revocation, subject and the remaining checks still apply."},"1215":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#recover-according-to-state","content":"Renewal through webhook or `NO_AUTH`"},"1216":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#recover-according-to-state","content":"The mTLS expiry check does not run in these modes. Define expiry and authorization policy in the corresponding admission process; the flag is not a universal prohibition."},"1217":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#recover-according-to-state","content":"Lost or inaccessible key"},"1218":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#recover-according-to-state","content":"You cannot prove possession of the previous identity. Authorize new admission and, if appropriate, controlled replacement; revoke the compromised identity."},"1219":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#recover-according-to-state","content":"Current identity revoked"},"1220":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#recover-according-to-state","content":"`simplereenroll` rejects the revoked current certificate. Investigate the reason and prepare an authorized readmission procedure; do not disable authentication to force it."},"1221":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#recover-according-to-state","content":"Device without an identity"},"1222":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#recover-according-to-state","content":"Use initial enrollment. For an existing entry, check the replacement restriction in provisioning."},"1223":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#recover-according-to-state","content":"Retired device"},"1224":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#recover-according-to-state","content":"Review the operational decision before readmission. Decommissioned state and revocation of the entire history are not equivalent."},"1225":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#recover-according-to-state","content":"Timeout, HTTP 500 or installation failure"},"1226":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#recover-according-to-state","content":"Inspect the device, issued certificates and history before retrying. A successor may have been issued or the previous identity revoked."},"1227":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#continuous-operation","content":"Schedule renewal with time for disconnections, trust distribution and consumer checks. Stagger requests across the population and bound retries within the window; authentication, subject and policy errors require correcting their cause. Maintain an admitted and tested recovery mechanism for lost keys and pairs that could not be installed."},"1228":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-35","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#continuous-operation","content":"Continue with Trust distribution, Devices and identities and Troubleshooting."},"1229":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","type":"page","content":"Enrollment troubleshooting","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Platform","IoT Fleets","Devices and identities","Enrollment with PKI"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting"},"1230":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","content":"Locate transport, authentication, registration, issuance and installation failures."},"1231":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#diagnostics-and-compatibility","content":"Diagnostics and compatibility"},"1232":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"Error codes and diagnostics"},"1233":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#compatibility-notes","content":"Compatibility notes"},"1234":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#est-enrollment-fails","content":"EST enrollment fails"},"1235":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","content":"Diagnose one operation and device at a time. Record the DMS/APS, endpoint, time, HTTP code, presented serial and CSR CN. Retain the response without including private keys or webhook credentials in the report."},"1236":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"The EST controller normally returns 400 when rejecting input and 500 when the service rejects or fails the operation. A 500 can also represent a policy denial; it does not mean retrying is safe. Gateway can produce its own codes and bodies. Examine the actual body and persisted result."},"1237":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"Symptom or message"},"1238":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"What to check"},"1239":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"curl rejects TLS, name or issuer"},"1240":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"URL, clock, server SAN and approved root in `est-trust.pem`. Resolve trust in Deployment; do not skip verification."},"1241":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"404 or missing APS"},"1242":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"Public route `/.well-known/est/{DMS_ID}/{operation}` and existing DMS. APS is not the service name."},"1243":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"400, CSR or format error"},"1244":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"`Content-Type: application/pkcs10`, Base64 of DER, valid signature and a body preserved without double encoding."},"1245":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"Missing credential or invalid certificate"},"1246":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"Operation mode, validating CA, dates, revocation and credential delivery by Gateway. Do not confuse server TLS trust with the bootstrap CA."},"1247":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"Webhook denies, times out or responds without authorization"},"1248":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"Configuration, connectivity and JSON response with `authorized: true`. There is no automatic fallback to `NO_AUTH`."},"1249":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"`unexpected status code: <n>: redirects are not followed`"},"1250":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"The webhook answered with a redirect. Configure the final absolute `http` or `https` URL in the webhook config; redirects are never followed."},"1251":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"`webhook response exceeds 1048576 bytes`"},"1252":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"The receiver returned more than 1 MiB of JSON. Reduce the response of the authorization webhook."},"1253":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"`webhook config must not reference files`"},"1254":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"The webhook config points to files (`ca_cert_file`, `mtls_options.cert_file`, `mtls_options.key_file`). For mTLS, enter the certificate and key as Base64-encoded PEM in `cert_content` and `key_content`, or as plain PEM; remove any other file field, including `ca_cert_file`, which has no inline equivalent (the receiver certificate must chain to the system trust store). See the webhook credentials guidance in DMS."},"1255":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"`mtls_options.cert_content must be base64-encoded PEM`"},"1256":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"The value is neither Base64-encoded PEM nor plain PEM: it is a file path or Base64 of non-PEM data. Enter the certificate and key as Base64-encoded PEM, like certificates elsewhere in the API, or as plain PEM (see the webhook settings in DMS). The same message names `mtls_options.key_content` when the key is the offending value."},"1257":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"`webhook mTLS certificate and key are invalid: …`"},"1258":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"The certificate and key do not form a matching pair. Enter both values from the same pair; the check runs when the DMS is saved and again on every webhook call."},"1259":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"400 `struct validation error` creating or updating a DMS"},"1260":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"The webhook config of the operation that uses it is invalid. Review `external_webhook_settings` in DMS."},"1261":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"HTTP 500 with an `err` body on enroll or reenroll"},"1262":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"Service failures reach the EST client as 500 with a body of `err` plus the message; webhook authorization errors are named there."},"1263":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"`device not preregistered`"},"1264":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"PRE\\_REGISTRATION requires an existing inventory entry."},"1265":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-35","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"`forbiddenNewEnrollment`"},"1266":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-36","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"An existing device requires replacement to be enabled, even in No Identity. Investigate before enabling the flag."},"1267":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-37","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"Different owning DMS"},"1268":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-38","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"CN/ID, global inventory and owning DMS; do not reuse an ID from another context."},"1269":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-39","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"`invalid RawSubject bytes`"},"1270":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-40","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"CSR subject versus the current certificate. Preserve its attributes as well as its CN."},"1271":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-41","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"`invalid reenroll window`"},"1272":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-42","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"Current identity's NotAfter and reenrollment\\_delta. Alert thresholds do not change that window."},"1273":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-43","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"Current certificate revoked"},"1274":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-44","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"Renewal rejected; prepare authorized recovery according to the cause."},"1275":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-45","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"CA, profile or signing error"},"1276":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-46","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"Active CA, available key, selected profile and restrictions. Successful cacerts does not prove issuance."},"1277":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-47","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"HTTP 200 without a device connection"},"1278":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-48","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"Installed pair, chain, uses, consumer trust and permissions. Also check the slot and history."},"1279":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-49","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"Timeout or error after issuance"},"1280":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-50","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"New certificates, current slot and previous identity's state before retrying."},"1281":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-51","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#compatibility-notes","content":"The examples use the contract of the examined backend. Do not automatically attribute that behavior to another release. Check the saved renewal mode and Gateway behavior with expired certificates and the bootstrap CA."},"1282":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-52","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#compatibility-notes","content":"The default response is Base64-encoded DER PKCS#7; PEM through `Accept: application/x-pem-file` is a Lamassu extension. ServerKeyGen returns multipart and requires handling each part separately. See the EST reference."},"1283":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-53","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#est-enrollment-fails","content":"Check HTTPS with the approved root and query cacerts for the correct APS."},"1284":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-54","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#est-enrollment-fails","content":"Review the saved DMS: protocol, registration, authentication for that operation, CA, profile and window."},"1285":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-55","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#est-enrollment-fails","content":"Verify the CSR locally and relate its CN to the inventory."},"1286":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-56","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#est-enrollment-fails","content":"Make one request, save headers/body and query the device and certificates."},"1287":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-57","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#est-enrollment-fails","content":"If you receive an identity, check the key, subject, use and connection with the consumer."},"1288":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-58","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#est-enrollment-fails","content":"External bootstrap revocation checks have limitations: absence of evidence can be accepted, and OCSP Unknown does not cause the same rejection as Revoked. Do not assume a policy that rejects every uncertainty. An intermediate CA in the TLS chain does not prove that the entire chain reached the DMS validator either."},"1289":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-59","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#est-enrollment-fails","content":"For logs, networking, pods or Gateway headers, continue in Deployment troubleshooting. For identities issued, revoked or bound partially, use Renewal and recovery and Devices and identities."},"1290":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","type":"page","content":"Trust distribution and updates","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Platform","IoT Fleets","Devices and identities","Enrollment with PKI"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution"},"1291":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","content":"Separate roots, intermediates and initial TLS trust when distributing or migrating certificates."},"1292":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#three-trust-relationships","content":"Three trust relationships"},"1293":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#what-cacerts-returns","content":"What cacerts returns"},"1294":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#install-the-required-material","content":"Install the required material"},"1295":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#migrate-trust","content":"Migrate trust"},"1296":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#check-the-update","content":"Check the update"},"1297":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","content":"This guide is for device and consumer trust administrators. You need issuer inventory, trust-store access and an authenticated update channel. Distributing certificates is separate from choosing trusted anchors."},"1298":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#three-trust-relationships","content":"Relationship"},"1299":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#three-trust-relationships","content":"Material prepared by its owner"},"1300":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#three-trust-relationships","content":"Device → EST server"},"1301":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#three-trust-relationships","content":"Previously verified server root, chain or pin and TLS name."},"1302":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#three-trust-relationships","content":"DMS → requester"},"1303":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#three-trust-relationships","content":"CAs and rules authorizing initial or renewal credentials."},"1304":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#three-trust-relationships","content":"Consumer → device"},"1305":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#three-trust-relationships","content":"Operational identity roots, intermediates, validation and permissions."},"1306":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#three-trust-relationships","content":"Obtaining a certificate does not automatically configure these relationships in third parties. Review the Trust model."},"1307":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#what-cacerts-returns","content":"The DMS may include the available downstream TLS certificate, selected Managed CAs and enrollment CA. Selecting the issuer does not include every ancestor. The set may contain leaves, roots and intermediates, including multiple hierarchies during migration."},"1308":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#what-cacerts-returns","content":"Position does not define the chain. Identify certificates by subject, issuer, AKI/SKI, signature and constraints. Download and inspect using EST client."},"1309":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#install-the-required-material","content":"Keep initial EST server trust separate from identity consumer trust."},"1310":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#install-the-required-material","content":"Select policy-approved roots as anchors."},"1311":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#install-the-required-material","content":"Retain intermediates for chain building or presentation; do not automatically turn them into roots."},"1312":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#install-the-required-material","content":"Present the leaf and required intermediates in mTLS. Normally the peer already trusts its root and does not need it sent."},"1313":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#install-the-required-material","content":"Verify chain, dates, names, usages and revocation from the consumer."},"1314":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#install-the-required-material","content":"Do not indiscriminately use all of `cacerts.pem` as `-CAfile`: this can expand trusted authorities, hide missing intermediates or trust a TLS leaf intended for another purpose."},"1315":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#migrate-trust","content":"Before changing Enrollment CA, inventory disconnected equipment, bootstrap and operational certificates, and consumers. Distribute the new root and required intermediates; check that a cohort accepts both old and new chains."},"1316":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#migrate-trust","content":"In the DMS, separate distributed CAs from the re-enrollment validation CAs at `reenrollment_settings.est_rfc7030_settings.client_certificate_settings.validation_cas`, used for re-enrollment credentials. That list is optional because the enrollment CA always validates re-enrollment credentials, but when switching the enrollment CA, add the previous issuance CA to it so old-CA identities keep re-enrolling during overlap. The inspected validator tries the enrollment CA followed by those CAs against the received leaf; accepting a multilevel chain requires checking what reaches the service and which issuer is configured."},"1317":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#migrate-trust","content":"Switch issuance, renew in cohorts and compare the installed serial with the active slot. Remove previous trust once no legitimate equipment needs it and policy permits ending overlap. Follow Hierarchy and rotation for the PKI operation."},"1318":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#check-the-update","content":"Test an old identity allowed during overlap, a new one, an unknown chain and the result after removing old trust. Keep trust-store version, approved set, date and result. Reachable `/cacerts` establishes distribution only; it does not establish installation or acceptance across every device."},"1319":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"page","content":"AWS IoT Core","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Platform","IoT Fleets","Devices and identities","Integrations"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core"},"1320":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","content":"Lamassu's connector for AWS IoT Core syncs device identities with the AWS platform, handling CA registration, Thing provisioning and certificate lifecycle automatically and event-driven."},"1321":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#connector-architecture","content":"Connector architecture"},"1322":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#prerequisites","content":"Prerequisites"},"1323":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#required-iam-permissions","content":"Required IAM permissions"},"1324":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#configuration-parameters","content":"Configuration parameters"},"1325":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#events-and-aws-resources","content":"Events and AWS resources"},"1326":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#ca-registration-in-aws-iot-core","content":"CA registration in AWS IoT Core"},"1327":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#how-to-request-registration","content":"How to request registration"},"1328":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#ca-registration-states","content":"CA registration states"},"1329":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#primary-account","content":"Primary Account"},"1330":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#secondary-account-sni-only","content":"Secondary Account (SNI-only)"},"1331":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#dms-configuration","content":"DMS configuration"},"1332":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#none-mode","content":"`none` mode"},"1333":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#auto-mode","content":"`auto` mode"},"1334":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#jitp-mode","content":"`jitp` mode"},"1335":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#dms-registration-mode-states","content":"DMS registration-mode states"},"1336":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#device-provisioning-automatic-mode","content":"Device provisioning (automatic mode)"},"1337":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#thing-lifecycle","content":"Thing lifecycle"},"1338":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#device-provisioning-jitp-mode","content":"Device provisioning (JITP mode)"},"1339":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#certificate-status-synchronization","content":"Certificate status synchronization"},"1340":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#certificate-status-states","content":"Certificate status states"},"1341":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#forced-disconnect-on-revocation","content":"Forced disconnect on revocation"},"1342":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#device-shadow-and-automation","content":"Device Shadow and automation"},"1343":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#what-the-connector-writes-to-the-shadow","content":"What the connector writes to the shadow"},"1344":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#aws-iot-policies","content":"AWS IoT policies"},"1345":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#troubleshooting","content":"Troubleshooting"},"1346":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","content":"Lamassu's integration with AWS IoT Core bridges the PKI managed by Lamassu and AWS's connectivity platform. When a device obtains its certificate through the EST enrollment process, the connector ensures that certificate and its associated identity are recognized in AWS IoT Core without manual intervention. The result is that the device can authenticate directly to AWS with the same X.509 certificate Lamassu issued."},"1347":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","content":"From a protocol standpoint, the device authenticates to AWS IoT Core via mutual TLS (mTLS): it presents its Lamassu-issued X.509 certificate as the client certificate, and AWS IoT Core verifies the certificate chain up to the CA registered in the account. Lamassu acts as the certification authority (CA); the connector ensures that CA is registered in AWS and that the device's certificate is known to the platform before the device attempts to connect (in `auto` mode) or on its first connection (in JITP mode)."},"1348":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","content":"This document is aimed both at the PKI administrator, who needs to configure the connector and register CAs, and at the device firmware developer, who needs to understand how Things are named, how the Device Shadow works and what happens when a certificate is revoked. For the firmware developer, the most important fact is that **the AWS Thing name (ThingName) always corresponds to the Common Name (CN) of the certificate issued by Lamassu**, regardless of the provisioning mode."},"1349":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#connector-architecture","content":"The AWS IoT Core connector is an independent Go process, a binary or container separate from Lamassu's core. In a monolithic deployment it is compiled by default (build tag `!noaws`) and activated with `aws_iot_manager.enabled: true` in the configuration file. In distributed deployments, it runs as its own container with access to Lamassu's CA, DMS Manager and Device Manager services over HTTP."},"1350":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#connector-architecture","content":"The connector does not poll Lamassu's services periodically. Instead, it **subscribes to Lamassu's internal event bus** (AMQP or AWS SQS/SNS, configurable) and reacts to the events it cares about: CA creation or update, DMS creation or update, device identity binding, certificate status change, certificate metadata update and device metadata update. This event-driven model ensures synchronization with AWS is nearly immediate and produces no polling load."},"1351":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#connector-architecture","content":"To avoid infinite loops, the connector ignores any event whose CloudEvent `source` field matches its own origin URI. This prevents the metadata writes the connector itself performs from re-triggering the same flow."},"1352":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#connector-architecture","content":"When several connectors run in parallel, for example for different AWS accounts, each instance has its own `connector_id`. All metadata the connector writes to Lamassu is stored under the key `lamassu.io/iot/{connector_id}`, allowing coexistence without collisions."},"1353":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#prerequisites","content":"Before enabling the connector you need an AWS account with the proper IAM permissions and the connector correctly configured. The deployment process (Docker Compose, Kubernetes or binary) is described in the deployment documentation."},"1354":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#required-iam-permissions","content":"The IAM identity operating the connector needs at minimum the following permissions on the target account's resources:"},"1355":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-35","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#required-iam-permissions","content":"IAM action"},"1356":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-36","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#required-iam-permissions","content":"Purpose"},"1357":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-37","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#required-iam-permissions","content":"`iot:GetRegistrationCode`"},