us identity."},"1688":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-43","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#configure-the-evaluation-dms","content":"ServerKeyGen"},"1689":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-44","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#configure-the-evaluation-dms","content":"Disabled; the operational key is generated in the client."},"1690":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-45","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#configure-the-evaluation-dms","content":"CA Distribution"},"1691":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-46","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#configure-the-evaluation-dms","content":"Include Enrollment CA enabled; Include Lamassu System CA disabled."},"1692":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-47","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#configure-the-evaluation-dms","content":"Equal duration and window allow immediate renewal testing. These are evaluation values; size production settings according to connectivity and recovery times. Save, reread both authentication blocks and retain the DMS ID. The console exposes independent editors for the enrollment and re-enrollment authentication; the DMS guide describes their fields, and you can also check the resource through the DMS API."},"1693":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-48","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#prepare-the-client-and-check-cacerts","content":"Place the four trust and bootstrap files in the new directory. Replace the URL with your installation's URL:"},"1694":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-49","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#prepare-the-client-and-check-cacerts","content":"The download must succeed and contain the expected enrollment root. Compare its fingerprint with `device-root.pem`. This check does not turn the response into initial trust or prove that you can issue."},"1695":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-50","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#enroll-the-device","content":"Generate a new key and CSR with the selected identifier:"},"1696":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-51","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#enroll-the-device","content":"Request the identity with the bootstrap credential and extract the certificate from the default response:"},"1697":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-52","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#enroll-the-device","content":"If curl fails, use Troubleshooting with the saved body. Do not convert it or repeat the request without querying inventory: a timeout or error can follow persisted issuance."},"1698":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-53","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#verify-the-obtained-identity","content":"Expect `device.crt: OK` and exit code 0 from `cmp`. Check the CN, serial, dates, Digital Signature and Client Authentication. The certificate must be a leaf: it must not declare `CA:TRUE` or Certificate Sign use. Check that its validity matches the one-hour profile."},"1699":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-54","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#verify-the-obtained-identity","content":"In Lamassu, open `est-device-001`. It must be created with the intended owning DMS, a current identity and the received certificate in its history. Compare the local serial with the slot; thresholds can show a renewal state rather than simply Active."},"1700":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-55","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#demonstrate-an-mtls-connection","content":"In a second terminal, enter the same directory and run `umask 077`. Create a local server certificate and start a test consumer. This server trusts `device-root.pem` and requires a valid client identity:"},"1701":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-56","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#demonstrate-an-mtls-connection","content":"Leave it running. In the first terminal, connect using the obtained identity:"},"1702":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-57","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#demonstrate-an-mtls-connection","content":"Expect HTTP `200`. The client's trust in this local server is its self-signed `consumer.crt`; the server verifies the device against `device-root.pem`. The HTML file displays OpenSSL diagnostic information."},"1703":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-58","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#demonstrate-an-mtls-connection","content":"With the same server still running, test that a request without a client certificate is rejected:"},"1704":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-59","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#demonstrate-an-mtls-connection","content":"Rejection must correspond to a missing certificate at the server, not a stopped server. Stop the consumer with Ctrl+C after the test. This exercise demonstrates TLS authentication and key possession; your application must also define authorization and revocation consumption. Server options are described in openssl-s\\_server."},"1705":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-60","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#result-and-continuity","content":"Check"},"1706":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-61","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#result-and-continuity","content":"Expected result"},"1707":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-62","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#result-and-continuity","content":"Registration"},"1708":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-63","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#result-and-continuity","content":"ID created automatically and correct DMS."},"1709":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-64","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#result-and-continuity","content":"Certificate"},"1710":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-65","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#result-and-continuity","content":"CN, profile, serial and key verified."},"1711":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-66","page_id":"/docs/pr-pr