ostics."},"2636":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting","content":"For Gateway, sign-in, pods, dependencies and messaging, see Deployment troubleshooting. For device enrollment, see EST diagnostics."},"2637":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting#issuance-fails","content":"Check"},"2638":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting#issuance-fails","content":"What to inspect"},"2639":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting#issuance-fails","content":"Next step"},"2640":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting#issuance-fails","content":"CA"},"2641":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting#issuance-fails","content":"Exists, is active and has usable dates."},"2642":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting#issuance-fails","content":"Authorities."},"2643":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting#issuance-fails","content":"Key"},"2644":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting#issuance-fails","content":"The record has a usable private key and the engine can sign."},"2645":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting#issuance-fails","content":"Try **Sign / Verify** in KMS; check provider permissions and availability."},"2646":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting#issuance-fails","content":"CSR"},"2647":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting#issuance-fails","content":"Correct PEM and verifiable signature."},"2648":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting#issuance-fails","content":"`openssl req -in request.csr -noout -verify -text`."},"2649":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting#issuance-fails","content":"Profile"},"2650":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting#issuance-fails","content":"Selected source, existing ID, allowed algorithm and size."},"2651":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting#issuance-fails","content":"Check Profiles precedence; CA and DMS resolve differently."},"2652":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting#issuance-fails","content":"Result"},"2653":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting#issuance-fails","content":"Appropriate subject, SAN, usages and dates."},"2654":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting#issuance-fails","content":"Compare CSR, profile and certificate; successful issuance does not establish consumer acceptance."},"2655":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting#issuance-fails","content":"For unexpected certificate fields, review `Honor Subject`, `Honor Key Usage`, `Honor Extended Key Usages` and `Honor Extensions`. The latter preserves SAN only, without validating entitlement to those names. Validity is not automatically clamped to CA expiration."},"2656":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting#issuance-fails","content":"If issuance fails with `400` and `CA Status inconsistent`, the issuing CA is not `ACTIVE` or is outside the validity period of its certificate. The stored status can lag behind the dates until the expiration monitor runs, so check the dates too. Reissue the CA while it is still valid, or issue from another CA."},"2657":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting#issuance-fails","content":"For CA reissuance failures, check revocation and date: reissuance is not supported for a revoked or already expired CA. For a subordinate CA, also check the status and dates of its parent. To change its key, use Hierarchy and rotation."},"2658":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting#ocsp-or-crl-do-not-reflect-a-change","content":"Check each boundary independently:"},"2659":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting#ocsp-or-crl-do-not-reflect-a-change","content":"**Record:** read the correct certificate again by serial and issuer. Confirm status, reason and time; expired or permanently revoked records reject further transitions."},"2660":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting#ocsp-or-crl-do-not-reflect-a-change","content":"**Endpoint:** inspect AIA and CDP. Query those URLs from the consumer’s network; an old route or incorrect issuer can explain a discrepancy."},"2661":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting#ocsp-or-crl-do-not-reflect-a-change","content":"**OCSP:** save a fresh response, verify signature and timestamps, and observe status. An HTTP error for an absent serial does not mean `Good` or guarantee a signed `Unknown`."},"2662":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting#ocsp-or-crl-do-not-reflect-a-change","content":"**CRL:** compare `latest_crl`, number and timestamps with the downloaded list. Check the serial in its contents. If unchanged, review `regenerate_on_revoke`, event delivery, jobs, signing and storage with the deployment operator."},"2663":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting#ocsp-or-crl-do-not-reflect-a-change","content":"**Client:** check cache, policy for expired or unavailable evidence, critical IDP extension and rejection of a new connection."},"2664":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting#ocsp-or-crl-do-not-reflect-a-change","content":"Reactivation from `CertificateHold` needs a new CRL for the client to stop seeing the hold. A hold cascaded from a CA is lifted by releasing that CA; a cascade from a CA revoked for good is not. Inspect every status and individual operation failure."},"2665":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting#the-chain-validates-but-the-connection-fails","content":"Check expected identity, SAN, KU/EKU, matching key, presented intermediates and consumer permissions. Distinguish server TLS trust, client authentication and action authorization. Follow Validation for positive and rejection tests."},"2666":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting-35","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/platform/pki/troubleshooting#the-chain-validates-but-the-connection-fails","content":"When escalating a problem, provide identifiers, error and relevant public evidence, including query timestamps and version. This distinguishes issuance, publication and consumer application failures."},"2667":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/security","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/security","type":"page","content":"Security","breadcrumbs":["Docs"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/security"},"2668":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/security-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/security","content":"How to report a security vulnerability in Lamassu privately, what to include in a report and which releases receive security fixes."},"2669":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/security-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/security","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/security#report-a-vulnerability","content":"Report a vulnerability"},"2670":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/security-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/security","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/security#what-to-include-in-a-report","content":"What to include in a report"},"2671":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/security-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/security","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/security#supported-versions","content":"Supported versions"},"2672":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/security-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/security","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/security#responsible-disclosure","content":"Responsible disclosure"},"2673":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/security-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/security","content":"Found a security vulnerability in lamassuiot, lamassu-dashboard, or lamassu-helm? This page explains how to report it privately, what to include in your report and which releases receive security fixes."},"2674":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/security-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/security#report-a-vulnerability","content":"Do not report security vulnerabilities through public GitHub issues, discussions, or pull requests. Public reports disclose the problem before maintainers can fix it."},"2675":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/security-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/security#report-a-vulnerability","content":"Instead, report privately using GitHub Security Advisories for the affected repository:"},"2676":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/security-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/security#report-a-vulnerability","content":"lamassuiot"},"2677":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/security-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/security#report-a-vulnerability","content":"lamassu-dashboard"},"2678":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/security-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/security#report-a-vulnerability","content":"lamassu-helm"},"2679":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/security-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/security#report-a-vulnerability","content":"This lets maintainers assess and address the issue before it is publicly disclosed."},"2680":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/security-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/security#report-a-vulnerability","content":"If private vulnerability reporting is not enabled for that repository, report the vulnerability privately to lamassuiot\\@lksnext.com before disclosing any details publicly."},"2681":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/security-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/security#what-to-include-in-a-report","content":"Describe the vulnerability, its potential impact, and steps to reproduce it using non-sensitive, redacted examples."},"2682":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/security-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/security#what-to-include-in-a-report","content":"Do not include in the report:"},"2683":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/security-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/security#what-to-include-in-a-report","content":"Credentials, tokens, or private keys"},"2684":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/security-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/security#what-to-include-in-a-report","content":"Customer data or customer-identifiable information"},"2685":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/security-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/security#what-to-include-in-a-report","content":"Confidential architecture or internal infrastructure details"},"2686":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/security-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/