#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Requisito"},"311":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-38","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Diseño recomendado"},"312":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-39","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Consecuencia"},"313":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-40","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Varias URL o servicios de Lamassu"},"314":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-41","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Un Gateway con varias rutas"},"315":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-42","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Una IP y un proxy fleet; es el comportamiento predeterminado del chart"},"316":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-43","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Gateways independientes e IP externas distintas"},"317":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-44","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Una VIP por Gateway"},"318":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-45","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Todos pueden usar 80/443; requiere un balanceador con un pool de direcciones"},"319":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-46","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Gateways independientes, un nodo y una IP"},"320":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-47","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Puertos externos diferentes"},"321":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-48","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Los clientes deben indicar puertos no estándar"},"322":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-49","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Terminación TLS/mTLS separada detrás de una IP"},"323":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-50","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Front door con enrutamiento SNI hacia Gateways internos"},"324":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-51","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Diseño avanzado; el front door usa TLS passthrough y cada Gateway termina su propio TLS"},"325":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-52","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Recursos Gateway separados pero proxy compartido"},"326":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-53","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Modo merged Gateway de Envoy"},"327":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-54","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Solo separación lógica; cada listener necesita una tupla única de puerto, protocolo y hostname"},"328":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-55","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Tres Services `LoadBalancer` independientes no pueden reservar a la vez los mismos puertos 80 y 443 mediante K3s ServiceLB. Usa un Gateway compartido, asigna VIP distintas con otro balanceador o utiliza puertos diferentes."},"329":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-56","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Envoy Gateway provisiona normalmente un proxy fleet por `Gateway`. Su modo merged Gateway puede compartir un fleet y una dirección, pero no es un cambio directo para varias releases de Lamassu: los listeners generados usan los mismos puertos y protocolos sin hostnames distintos, por lo que entran en conflicto salvo que personalices el diseño."},"330":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-57","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Usa un front door con SNI solo cuando los Gateways internos deban mantener políticas TLS o mTLS independientes:"},"331":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-58","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Esto requiere hostnames SNI distintos y configuración de red externa al chart de Lamassu."},"332":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-59","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#certificados-de-cliente-y-cabeceras-de-identidad","content":"El chart aplica automáticamente una `ClientTrafficPolicy` llamada `enable-mtls` a su Gateway compartido; ningún valor de Helm la activa ni la desactiva. La terminación TLS acepta peticiones con o sin certificado de cliente: los dispositivos pueden presentar uno, pero no están obligados a hacerlo. Antes de reenviar una petición, el Gateway elimina las cabeceras de identidad y de certificado que un cliente podría suministrarse por sí mismo: `X-Principal-Id`, `X-Lms-Source`, `X-Forwarded-Client-Cert`, `X-Forwarded-Cert`, `X-Forwarded-Tls-Client-Cert` (la grafía de Traefik), `Ssl-Client-Cert` y `X-Amzn-Mtls-Clientcert`. La grafía de Traefik se incluye porque los backends que aceptan `X-Forwarded-Tls-Client-Cert` directamente recibirían, si no, datos de identidad de certificado suministrados por el propio cliente sin haber presentado un certificado. Tras la eliminación, Envoy añade su propia cabecera `X-Forwarded-Client-Cert` con el certificado presentado y su cadena, de modo que los servicios que leen la identidad del certificado reciben solo valores generados por el Gateway. Ningún valor de Helm modifica la lista de cabeceras eliminadas. La página Control de acceso describe cómo aprovecha `authz` esta protección para mantener `X-Principal-ID` fuera del alcance de los clientes."},"333":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-60","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#guía-de-decisión","content":"Si un Gateway puede gestionar TLS y el enrutamiento, usa el valor predeterminado del chart."},"334":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-61","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#guía-de-decisión","content":"Si los Gateways necesitan políticas independientes y puedes asignar IP, usa una VIP por Gateway."},"335":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-62","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#guía-de-decisión","content":"Si solo necesitas separar los recursos Kubernetes, evalúa merged Gateway y usa tuplas de listener únicas."},"336":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-63","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#guía-de-decisión","content":"Si los data planes y la terminación TLS deben ser independientes detrás de una IP, añade un front door con TLS passthrough y SNI."},"337":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-64","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#guía-de-decisión","content":"Si nada de lo anterior es posible, usa puertos externos distintos o cambia el diseño de red."},"338":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-65","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#proxy-de-salida","content":"Los clientes internos de Lamassu — la conexión con el motor de Vault, las llamadas entre servicios y los webhooks salientes — respetan las variables de entorno `HTTP_PROXY`, `HTTPS_PROXY` y `NO_PROXY`. La excepción es el conector del motor de autorización: usa su propio transporte y no consulta estas variables de proxy. Si tu despliegue enruta el tráfico de salida por un proxy, incluye los nombres de servicio internos del clúster en `NO_PROXY` (por ejemplo `.svc,.cluster.local`) para que el tráfico interno permanezca dentro del clúster. El tráfico de loopback nunca se envía por un proxy."},"339":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-66","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#proxy-de-salida","content":"El transporte predeterminado de estos clientes acota el timeout de conexión (30 segundos), el handshake TLS (10 segundos) y la reutilización de conexiones inactivas (90 segundos), de modo que una dependencia inalcanzable falla rápido en lugar de bloquearse; estos valores son los predeterminados del transporte de Go, no configuración de Lamassu. HTTP/2 se negocia cuando el otro extremo lo soporta. El conector del motor de autorización mantiene su propio transporte sin estos timeouts de conexión ni de handshake TLS; solo su timeout global de petición de 30 segundos acota cada llamada."},"340":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-67","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#verifica-la-ruta-de-tráfico","content":"Comprueba, en orden:"},"341":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-68","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#verifica-la-ruta-de-tráfico","content":"El `Gateway` muestra `Accepted=True` y `Programmed=True`."},"342":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-69","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#verifica-la-ruta-de-tráfico","content":"Su estado contiene la dirección esperada."},"343":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-70","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#verifica-la-ruta-de-tráfico","content":"El Service `LoadBalancer` generado tiene una dirección externa utilizable."},"344":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-71","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#verifica-la-ruta-de-tráfico","content":"El puerto 443 de esa dirección es accesible desde la red del cliente."},"345":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-72","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#verifica-la-ruta-de-tráfico","content":"DNS resuelve al endpoint accesible externamente."},"346":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-73","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#verifica-la-ruta-de-tráfico","content":"El certificado contiene el nombre DNS o la IP usada por el cliente."},"347":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-74","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#verifica-la-ruta-de-tráfico","content":"Gateway API trata las direcciones como estado deseado que el controlador puede asignar o rechazar; consulta la introducción a Gateway API para conocer el modelo."},"348":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","type":"page","content":"Kubernetes self-managed","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Despliegue","Kubernetes autogest