","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","content":"Prepararás un DMS de evaluación, enrolarás `est-device-001` desde el cliente y usarás su identidad frente a un consumidor local que exige certificado. El recorrido conecta la política del administrador con el material que realmente instala el dispositivo."},"1654":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#antes-de-empezar","content":"Instancia Lamassu accesible por HTTPS y permisos para CAs, perfiles, DMS y lectura de dispositivos/certificados."},"1655":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#antes-de-empezar","content":"Bash, OpenSSL 3.x, curl con `--fail-with-body` y dos terminales en tu equipo. Trabaja en un directorio nuevo con acceso restringido."},"1656":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#antes-de-empezar","content":"Una CA raíz activa que emita directamente, con clave disponible y vigencia suficiente. Sigue Crea tu primera CA. Guarda su certificado público verificado como `device-root.pem`."},"1657":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#antes-de-empezar","content":"El identificador global `est-device-001` libre. Este recorrido utiliza registro automático: no crees primero el dispositivo desde la consola."},"1658":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#antes-de-empezar","content":"La raíz aprobada para el HTTPS de Lamassu en `est-trust.pem`, obtenida por un canal independiente. Puede ser distinta de la CA de dispositivos; prepara red/TLS en Despliegue."},"1659":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#prepara-la-credencial-inicial","content":"Emite un certificado final bootstrap con `CN=est-device-001`, clave propia y uso Client Authentication. Puedes seguir Emite y verifica un certificado, sustituyendo su CN y guardando el resultado como `bootstrap.crt` y `bootstrap.key`. Elige una validez que cubra esta prueba y comprueba la pareja y la cadena."},"1660":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#prepara-la-credencial-inicial","content":"Para esta evaluación aislada puede emitirlo la misma CA raíz. La identidad operativa tendrá una clave y un certificado distintos. El CN igual facilita la lectura del ejemplo; la autenticación inicial por certificado no vincula por sí sola el CN del bootstrap con el ID pedido. Revisa la admisión antes de aplicar la política a una población."},"1661":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#configura-el-dms-de-evaluación","content":"Crea un perfil final explícito, compatible con EC P-256, con **Honor Subject**, CN de la CSR, **Digital Signature**, **Client Authentication** y una validez de **1 hora** dentro de la vigencia de la raíz. No habilites firma como CA. Las reglas y precedencia se explican en Perfiles."},"1662":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#configura-el-dms-de-evaluación","content":"Crea el DMS `Acme EST Evaluation` con esta configuración:"},"1663":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#configura-el-dms-de-evaluación","content":"Ajuste"},"1664":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#configura-el-dms-de-evaluación","content":"Valor de evaluación"},"1665":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#configura-el-dms-de-evaluación","