"},"1739":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepara-el-dms","content":"Vuelve a abrir el DMS y confirma que la CA de enrolamiento es la prevista y que el servicio aparece en el inventario."},"1740":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepara-el-dms","content":"Estos ajustes preparan la política DMS. Los pasos siguientes realizan el alta y la asignación desde la consola; no envían una solicitud EST ni prueban la admisión por ese protocolo."},"1741":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#registra-el-dispositivo","content":"Abre **Managed Devices** y la acción de registro. Completa:"},"1742":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#registra-el-dispositivo","content":"**Device ID**: `device-001`."},"1743":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#registra-el-dispositivo","content":"**Registration Authority**: el DMS que acabas de preparar; la etiqueta identifica al servicio que cumple el rol de autoridad de registro."},"1744":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#registra-el-dispositivo","content":"**Icon** y **Tags**: clasificación opcional."},"1745":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#registra-el-dispositivo","content":"Confirma el registro."},"1746":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#comprueba-el-estado-inicial","content":"Abre el dispositivo. Debe aparecer en **No Identity** y mostrar el DMS propietario seleccionado."},"1747":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#comprueba-el-estado-inicial","content":"El registro crea la entrada de inventario; el certificado todavía debe asociarse."},"1748":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#asigna-una-identidad","content":"Selecciona **Assign Identity*