/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management#crear-o-importar-claves","content":"Necesitas permisos de administración de claves y un motor accesible. El perfil de emisión debe admitir el algoritmo que eliges si la clave va a utilizarse en una CA o CSR. Abre **Create New Key** y elige generación o importación."},"2366":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management-58","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management#generar-un-nuevo-par-de-claves","content":"Si la clave va a nacer dentro de Lamassu, el flujo recomendado es generar un nuevo par gestionado directamente por uno de los motores configurados."},"2367":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management-59","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management#generar-un-nuevo-par-de-claves","content":"En la primera pantalla del asistente, elige **Generate New Key Pair** y después define los parámetros principales:"},"2368":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management-60","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management#generar-un-nuevo-par-de-claves","content":"**Key Name**: nombre único y descriptivo."},"2369":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management-61","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management#generar-un-nuevo-par-de-claves","content":"**Crypto Engine**: motor que custodiará la clave."},"2370":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management-62","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management#generar-un-nuevo-par-de-claves","content":"*