,"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management#importar-un-par-existente","content":"Cuando Lamassu debe operar con una raíz de confianza creada por un tercero."},"2377":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management-69","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management#importar-un-par-existente","content":"En el asistente, elige **Import Existing Key Pair** y completa los campos solicitados:"},"2378":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management-70","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management#importar-un-par-existente","content":"**Key Name**: nombre descriptivo dentro de Lamassu IoT."},"2379":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management-71","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management#importar-un-par-existente","content":"**Crypto Engine**: motor que custodiará la clave importada."},"2380":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management-72","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management#importar-un-par-existente","content":"**Tags**: etiquetas para organización y búsqueda."},"2381":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management-73","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management#importar-un-par-existente","content":"**Metadata**: información adicional opcional."},"2382":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management-74","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management#importar-un-par-existente","content":"**Private Key (PEM)**: clave privada en formato PEM."},"2383":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management-75","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management#importar-un-par-existente","content":"Si la importación termina correctamente, abre el registro, comprueba motor y clave pública y realiza una firma de prueba. Una clave no exportable en un HSM no puede cargarse mediante este formulario PEM: configura el acceso al motor y comprueba cómo se registra la clave existente. Revisa dependencias y recursos que puedan haberse creado en el proveedor si una operación falla a mitad."},"2384":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management-76","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management#operaciones-sobre-una-clave","content":"Cada clave registrada dispone de una vista de detalle y de varias acciones operativas."},"2385":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management-77","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management#ver-detalles","content":"La pantalla **View Details** concentra la información técnica y administrativa de la clave."},"2386":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management-78","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management#ver-detalles","content":"En la pestaña **Overview** se muestran, entre otros, estos campos:"},"2387":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management-79","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management#ver-detalles","content":"**Key Name**: nombre descriptivo."},"2388":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management-80","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management#ver-detalles","content":"**Key Identifier**: identificador único del sistema. Lamassu utiliza formatos de ID basados en PKCS11."},"2389":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management-81","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management#ver-detalles","content":"**Tags**: etiquetas asociadas."},"2390":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management-82","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management#ver-detalles","content":"**Aliases**: nombres alternativos."},"2391":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management-83","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management#ver-detalles","content":"**Crypto Engine**: motor en el que reside la clave."},"2392":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management-84","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management#ver-detalles","content":"**Algorithm, Key Size & Strength**: algoritmo, parámetros y nivel de fortaleza."},"2393":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management-85","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/key-management#ver-detalles","content":"La sección **Related Entities** muestra qué objetos de Lamassu dependen de esa clave."},"2394":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platfo