quickstarts/overview#continúa-según-tu-objetivo","content":"Para operar certificados, continúa con Certificados y Validación."},"2627":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview#continúa-según-tu-objetivo","content":"Para gestionar una identidad de dispositivo en Lamassu, sigue Registro manual. Ese recorrido incluye la preparación del DMS."},"2628":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview#continúa-según-tu-objetivo","content":"Para que el dispositivo solicite su certificado, prepara el DMS y el cliente EST."},"2629":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"page","content":"Resolución de problemas PKI","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","PKI","Resolución de problemas"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting"},"2630":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","content":"Diagnostica emisión de certificados, OCSP y CRL."},"2631":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#la-emisión-falla","content":"La emisión falla"},"2632":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-75/es/platf